    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1752733358\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1752733358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1752733358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752733358\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/7419f14afc56405c4effcad624ac8545.avif?t=1752733358\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2724Story\u2724</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The female warrior Hilda embarked on a long journey with the Brave to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They arrived at their final destination, the Tower of the Demon Lord Vah Mala.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as they defeat the Demon Lord, their adventure ends\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, just as they were thinLord, the powerful and evil miasma prevented them from entering the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, the Brave stood in front of the tower, determined to suppress the miasma with his magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Hilda entered the tower alone to fight the Demon Lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the Brave depletes his mana, the protection will disappear, and Hilda won't be able to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before that happens, she has to take down the Demon Lord. Hilda strengthened her determination and stepped into the tower alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/f1aa17c9aa43be607d97042b073d8491.avif?t=1752733358\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2724Game Content\u2724</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the main stage of this adventure, the Tower. Every floor has a village, with a total of five areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The habitants of the Tower are perverted Demons that Hilda can't communicate with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, due to a certain opportunity, Hilda began to be able to understand the language of Demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After learning that she could communicate with Demons, Hilda's attitude gradually changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Can Hilda fulfill her promise to the Brave and defeat the Demon Lord?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 Or will she happily accept the sexual harassment from Demons, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>give up her beloved Brave, and become a resident of the Tower?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will be your free choice after experiencing various events...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/2eb5421ce528f36d109d67e48367b787.avif?t=1752733358\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551290/extras/6cd142ff6172e979c73482a3529b274c.avif?t=1752733358\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2724Game Features\u2724:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tedious battles, none at all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribute EXP points obtained through H in the skill tree to further develop into depravity!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience points gained through Sex can be distributed in the skill tree to become even more slutty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The NPCs with H scenes are marked with heart icons, maLord them easy to find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the memory room , you can easily open all H events with one click!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The illustration changes with various lewd costumes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 7 different endings prepared for various plots! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
