h\" >In the memory room , you can easily open all H events with one click!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The illustration changes with various lewd costumes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 7 different endings prepared for various plots! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
